00:24:00.181 --> 00:24:03.180
So, all of these work
in different forces and

00:24:03.181 --> 00:24:06.115
there are lots of systems
and lots of efforts.

00:24:06.116 --> 00:24:08.280
They're in fact at
the frontier of this.

00:24:08.281 --> 00:24:10.695
I want to list out
