for us to get ahead

00:24:18.286 --> 00:24:21.380
in this world where I think
knowledge is increasingly

00:24:21.381 --> 00:24:24.800
important like unsupervised,
unsupervised, autonomous.

00:24:24.801 --> 00:24:26.300
These are all keywords basically

00:24:26.301 --> 00:24:27.860
we say we can't put humans

