and depend on humans to do

00:24:29.381 --> 00:24:31.385
the final verification
in all the cases.

00:24:31.386 --> 00:24:33.010
How do I unstructure?

00:24:33.011 --> 00:24:34.905
When I look at a webpage,

00:24:34.906 --> 00:24:37.190
it's not just the head
sites that I can create

00:24:37.191 --> 00:24:40.030
templates and do
wrapper induction,

00:24:40.031 --> 00:24:41.925
site understanding, like can I

00:24:41.926 --> 00:24:44.815
understand the unstructured
nature of information?

00:24:44.816 --> 00:24:46.575
Can I understand and cluster?

00:24:46.576 --> 00:24:48.095
Can I extract facts?

00:24:48.096 --> 00:24:49.670
Can I test that hypothesis

00:24:49.671 --> 00:24:51.260
through verification
and validation?

00:24:51.261 --> 00:24:54.240
That's a whole body of
work that pushes from

00:24:54.241 --> 00:24:57.610
the head to in fact
that torso tail.

00:24:57.611 --> 00:24:59.555
Knowledge and semantic embedding.

00:24:59.556 --> 00:25:01.415
You got lots of today

00:25:01.416 --> 00:25:05.120
explicit knowledge that's
present today through years and

00:25:05.121 --> 00:25:08.160
decades of human aggregation or

00:25:08.161 --> 00:25:10.770
capabilities aggregation
and yet we're

00:25:10.771 --> 00:25:13.370
