and how do we seed it?

00:25:13.371 --> 00:25:16.010
How do we anchor
that knowledge so that

00:25:16.011 --> 00:25:19.170
you build upon it as opposed
to restart from scratch?

00:25:19.171 --> 00:25:22.045
I'll just pick another one
like multilingual.

00:25:22.046 --> 00:25:23.370
Language fundamentally is

00:25:23.371 --> 00:25:24.750
multilingual and in
fact information on

00:25:24.751 --> 00:25:28.635
