and you're like it's
not that useful.

00:25:43.051 --> 00:25:45.890
So, these are lots of
active research both

00:25:45.891 --> 00:25:49.830
within technology
product companies in

00:25:49.831 --> 00:25:52.650
research as well as in
Academia I encourage

00:25:52.651 --> 00:25:54.530
continued invasion
and we will look to

00:25:54.531 --> 00:25:56.950
partner in any and all of these.

00:25:56.951 --> 00:26:00.435
But let's share a little bit
of our learnings.

00:26:00.436 --> 00:26:01.680
There are many things we

00:26:01.681 --> 00:26:05.155
did throughout all the systems
that you heard about

00:26:05.156 --> 00:26:07.610
but I'll just pick
a couple that I think are

00:26:07.611 --> 00:26:11.270
really hard problems and we've

00:26:11.271 --> 00:26:13.140
