00:26:15.716 --> 00:26:18.410
But I'll just use
that hopefully to tee

00:26:18.411 --> 00:26:20.020
up the areas where I

00:26:20.021 --> 00:26:21.955
think there's productive
research should be done.

00:26:21.956 --> 00:26:24.645
One is the inherent complexity
of the real world.

00:26:24.646 --> 00:26:25.740
We talked a little bit about it,

00:26:25.741 --> 00:26:27.200
I will share some of
the learnings that we

00:26:27.201 --> 00:26:28.925
had in addressing that.

00:26:28.926 --> 00:26:31.650
The second is this symbolic

00:26:31.651 --> 00:26:33.520
versus neural approach where

00:26:33.521 --> 00:26:35.435
you can get the best
