00:27:01.191 --> 00:27:02.360
So, I'll just list out some,

00:27:02.361 --> 00:27:04.755
each one has its own challenges,

00:27:04.756 --> 00:27:06.940
we've made some progress
for it but I wouldn't say

00:27:06.941 --> 00:27:09.410
that we've kind of
